## Context
Author decision 2026-11-01: "Guard L1 only". Brood lesson L1 (conception/2026-11-01-brood-harness-run.md): a non-interactive CLI hangs on an open stdin. Enforce in scripts/guard-destructive-bash.sh.
Probe (timeout 20, `sleep 30 | codex exec "say ok"`): codex exec hung (rc 124, "Reading additional input from stdin..."), so it is included.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] `pi --print|-p` and `codex exec` with no stdin redirect, heredoc, here-string or pipe-in are blocked, message names `</dev/null` and rules/coding-bash.md
- [ ] `pi --help`, `pi` without print flag, quoted/commented text stay allowed
- [ ] tests in tests/test_guard_destructive_bash.py
